  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hoima Village Based Development Programme (VIBADEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&#xb7; To increase income and foodsecurity of 1800 households in Buseesa parish.
&#xb7; To improve household health status and community health service delivery systems in Buseesa parish.
&#xb7; To mainstream gender in all programme sectors, improve gender justice and reduce human rights violation in Buseesa parish.
&#xb7; To strengthen the programme&apos;s institutional capacity for effective mobilization, implementation and coordination of development activities in Buseesa parish.</narrative>
  </description>
